          "source": "",
          "thread": "Justin Sun custody takeover",
          "why": "The announcement that BiT Global—linked to Justin Sun—would co-custody WBTC's BTC reserves triggered immediate protocol-level responses and dominated click volume across multiple news cycles."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "MakerDAO/Sky WBTC offboarding",
          "why": "MakerDAO's governance vote to remove WBTC as collateral was a concrete, high-stakes outcome readers tracked from proposal through execution, affecting billions in open positions."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Aave and lending risk limits",
          "why": "LlamaRisk and Llama Risk proposals to cut WBTC LTV to zero on Aave represented the practical risk-management debate readers wanted to follow in real time."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "WBTC supply collapse",
          "why": "The disappearance of over 86,000 WBTC from circulation in a single year was a measurable signal of market-wide loss of confidence that readers found alarming."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Wrapped BTC alternatives emerging",
          "why": "cbBTC, dlcBTC, and swBTC all surfaced as credible replacements precisely because the custody controversy created demand for trust-minimized or non-custodial alternatives."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "HTX proof-of-reserves opacity",
          "why": "HTX redeeming thousands of WBTC without proof-of-reserves, and later burning 5,182 WBTC, raised questions about undisclosed movements of BTC backing tied to the Sun ecosystem."
        }
      ]
